1
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:09,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经过去一周了</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:10,176 --> 00:00:13,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋虚假指控的事已经解决了</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:14,263 --> 00:00:17,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么还是没有徒弟回来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:18,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>真让人火大！</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:18,893 --> 00:00:21,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在是明治维新的时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:26,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>事情一旦改变 就覆水难收了</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:26,525 --> 00:00:28,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>说到让人火大 你的年龄 剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:29,695 --> 00:00:31,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>这幅容颜居然28了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:32,073 --> 00:00:33,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>骗人！欺诈！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:33,699 --> 00:00:36,410
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前是维新志士的话
也太年轻了吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:37,495 --> 00:00:40,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下30多就没问题了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:44,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>也有问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:46,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>这还真是难办呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:01:02,812 --> 00:01:06,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:23,476 --> 00:02:26,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟着急也没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:26,103 --> 00:02:28,856
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的徒弟很快就会回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:28,939 --> 00:02:31,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在道场没人陪我训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:32,068 --> 00:02:35,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才每天都跑到朋友的道场训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:35,863 --> 00:02:38,783
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你从来都不帮我训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:38,866 --> 00:02:42,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃 在下只是不是很喜欢用竹刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:44,121 --> 00:02:45,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:46,248 --> 00:02:48,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 这小子是扒手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:48,125 --> 00:02:50,086
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是你的钱袋吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:50,169 --> 00:02:52,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 放开我 你个丑女！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:52,463 --> 00:02:54,465
<c.simplifiedchinese>丑女？你真失礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:02:54,548 --> 00:02:57,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>很多人都说我是剑术美人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:57,385 --> 00:02:58,761
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 丑女！</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:02:58,844 --> 00:03:03,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 偷了就偷了</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:04,225 --> 00:03:06,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>孩子 下次别被抓到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:08,646 --> 00:03:10,689
<c.simplifiedchinese>但…但是剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:18,614 --> 00:03:20,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是小孩子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:20,783 --> 00:03:23,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是东京武士之子 明神弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:23,661 --> 00:03:26,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没那么堕落
不需要陌生人同情！</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:26,205 --> 00:03:31,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看你有剑 想着捉弄你一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:31,168 --> 00:03:33,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要误会了 笨蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:36,424 --> 00:03:39,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>-孩子
-和你说了我不是小孩子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:40,511 --> 00:03:46,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来像个孩子
但内心已经像个大人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:47,017 --> 00:03:49,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 在下低估你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:55,234 --> 00:03:57,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>好没礼貌的孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:04,493 --> 00:04:05,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>（甜酒）</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:16,922 --> 00:04:20,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>东京好热闹呀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:20,134 --> 00:04:23,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你来这之前在哪里呀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:23,179 --> 00:04:25,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么特定的地方 就随处逛逛</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:25,806 --> 00:04:27,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:28,684 --> 00:04:30,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>他为什么想做浪客呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:34,148 --> 00:04:38,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>大多数维新志士都放下刀剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:43,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治政府享高位了</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:45,367 --> 00:04:47,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来你有问题要问在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:50,873 --> 00:04:52,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:52,124 --> 00:04:56,754
<c.simplifiedchinese>每个人都有一两件不想谈论的往事</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:58,589 --> 00:05:00,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的没事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:00,883 --> 00:05:02,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:02,259 --> 00:05:04,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫你用东西把它盖住了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:04,261 --> 00:05:05,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:05,554 --> 00:05:08,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>就两年前 都还有很多人佩剑呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:08,557 --> 00:05:11,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>看 没人在意它</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:11,977 --> 00:05:14,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚刚还有个小鬼惹你麻烦呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:14,271 --> 00:05:16,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>城市里很多警察</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:19,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使是把逆刃刀 下次也会被抓的</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:19,109 --> 00:05:21,070
<c.simplifiedchinese>抓了就抓了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:21,153 --> 00:05:23,072
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:25,825 --> 00:05:27,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要去道场训练了</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:28,077 --> 00:05:30,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 替我去杂货店买点东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:30,246 --> 00:05:31,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>味噌、盐和酱油</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:32,039 --> 00:05:33,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>都是很重的东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:33,749 --> 00:05:34,959
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要发牢骚！</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:48,597 --> 00:05:50,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰一下 小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:50,391 --> 00:05:54,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>这条路是去警视厅的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:54,979 --> 00:05:56,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊…对</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:56,814 --> 00:06:00,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>这条路尽头 在主路上右转</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:00,484 --> 00:06:01,485
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:02,027 --> 00:06:04,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到了吧 请快一点！</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:08,951 --> 00:06:11,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>我从没在这附近见过他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:11,245 --> 00:06:12,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>是什么人呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:14,331 --> 00:06:15,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的在这个小镇吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:26,927 --> 00:06:28,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:28,929 --> 00:06:31,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天是还债最后一天了</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,517
<c.simplifiedchinese>你准备好了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>-还没
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:36,103 --> 00:06:37,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:37,605 --> 00:06:39,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要我在晚上前准备好
就没问题了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:41,358 --> 00:06:42,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>我介先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:46,739 --> 00:06:50,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢这样和我说话 臭小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:50,242 --> 00:06:51,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:51,368 --> 00:06:55,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>给不了钱 你就没价值了</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:57,958 --> 00:06:59,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>晚上我们再来</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:59,918 --> 00:07:03,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>给不了钱的话
就准备好接受严惩吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:06,175 --> 00:07:07,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>记得带！</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:16,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>好像出事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:18,354 --> 00:07:20,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 发生什么事了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:20,272 --> 00:07:21,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>抓人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:21,899 --> 00:07:25,069
<c.simplifiedchinese>警察正在追违反废刀令的人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:27,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:30,324 --> 00:07:32,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>你小子别跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:33,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>快束手就擒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:34,912 --> 00:07:36,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们还真是坚持不懈</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:38,457 --> 00:07:39,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>是那家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:40,167 --> 00:07:41,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来没办法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:41,543 --> 00:07:43,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能暂时让他们抓走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:44,964
<c.simplifiedchinese>让一让！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:45,589 --> 00:07:47,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们挡住剑客警官的路了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:47,967 --> 00:07:50,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>让开 要不我就挥剑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:02,398 --> 00:08:04,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>宇治木警官</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:04,274 --> 00:08:05,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>干得好</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:05,693 --> 00:08:07,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>剩下的交给我们吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:07,945 --> 00:08:11,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你们可以解散了
-但这个人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:11,991 --> 00:08:16,203
<c.simplifiedchinese>他没有拔剑的迹象
我们也已经包围了他</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:16,286 --> 00:08:19,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的没必要请剑客警官来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:20,791 --> 00:08:22,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是三等军士</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:25,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>却在给我这个
萨摩藩出身的维新志士提意见？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:26,338 --> 00:08:28,465
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说“解散” 就赶紧消失在我眼前</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:30,634 --> 00:08:33,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不把剑拔出来呢 绅士？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:34,179 --> 00:08:36,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在东京内持剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:36,724 --> 00:08:39,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定对自己的剑术很自信吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:39,518 --> 00:08:42,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不会为了好玩而佩剑挥舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:48,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是为了告诉你
在下佩剑不是为了展示力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:51,196 --> 00:08:52,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:53,741 --> 00:08:56,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们是一伙的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:56,326 --> 00:08:57,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士 不要过来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:03,625 --> 00:09:06,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来 我要砍断你的和服羞辱你</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:07,171 --> 00:09:08,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>再问你一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:09,089 --> 00:09:10,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不拔剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:12,259 --> 00:09:13,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:14,178 --> 00:09:16,180
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的是警察吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:16,263 --> 00:09:17,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>千真万确</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:23,145
<c.simplifiedchinese>允许持剑合法杀人的警察</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:23,228 --> 00:09:25,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要因为你是政府官员就动用武力</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:25,898 --> 00:09:28,108
<c.simplifiedchinese>-简直骇人听闻！
-太不要脸了 混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:29,651 --> 00:09:32,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是蠢蛋 竟对我大喊大叫</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:33,238 --> 00:09:35,074
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种行为符合拒绝服从官员命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:35,157 --> 00:09:37,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>每个人都抓起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:37,367 --> 00:09:39,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>允许拔剑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:42,998
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何反抗者 杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:51,632
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:52,216 --> 00:09:53,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个小镇的市民</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:54,343 --> 00:09:56,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要对这些人拔剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:58,013 --> 00:10:00,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>想找对手的话 在下在此恭候</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:02,101 --> 00:10:05,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是好好先生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:06,396 --> 00:10:09,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀？你的剑可真奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:09,525 --> 00:10:12,069
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎样 现在我有权利杀你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:14,655 --> 00:10:16,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:16,323 --> 00:10:20,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>有时必须杀人来保持自己的敏锐度</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:25,332 --> 00:10:26,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:31,672 --> 00:10:34,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了 他是冒名顶替的</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:34,508 --> 00:10:35,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>对…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:35,509 --> 00:10:41,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来晚了
之前在处理西南战争的后事</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:41,682 --> 00:10:44,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>但如果仔细想想 也很明显</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:44,810 --> 00:10:48,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村可不是会犯下这种暴行的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:49,148 --> 00:10:53,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>确实 他杀人无数
配称“刽子手拔刀斋”</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:54,319 --> 00:10:58,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他从来不会肆意杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:58,907 --> 00:11:01,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>他过去做的一切
都是为了新时代 明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:01,785 --> 00:11:06,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是用自己的剑
救了很多维新志士的命的英雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:06,999 --> 00:11:11,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不是他 明治时代都不会到来</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:14,381 --> 00:11:20,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想找到他
给他在帝国军队安排一个领导地位</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:20,429 --> 00:11:22,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>关于这点…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:23,348 --> 00:11:27,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>罪犯一大早就被绑在警视厅门口了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:27,144 --> 00:11:29,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我们不知道是谁干的</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:30,439 --> 00:11:33,525
<c.simplifiedchinese>但问他们 他们说
“被真的拔刀斋识破了”</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:33,609 --> 00:11:34,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:34,735 --> 00:11:38,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟这是不可信的犯罪分子说的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:39,573 --> 00:11:41,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>长官 不好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:41,325 --> 00:11:44,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋 这还有客人 至少敲一下门！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:44,494 --> 00:11:46,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:46,163 --> 00:11:48,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是 剑客警官…</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:48,498 --> 00:11:51,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>宇治木那家伙又在惹麻烦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:51,877 --> 00:11:53,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑客警官？</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:53,754 --> 00:11:54,963
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没听说过这样的番队</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:55,047 --> 00:12:01,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是为这次拔刀斋事件成立的番队</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:01,261 --> 00:12:06,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>但都是些残暴的人
而他们的长官是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:06,892 --> 00:12:08,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩出身的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:09,061 --> 00:12:10,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也很难对付他</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:12,022 --> 00:12:16,485
<c.simplifiedchinese>根据地域来源
维新志士可以分为五类</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:16,568 --> 00:12:23,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩 长州藩 土佐藩
肥前藩和其他如水户藩和福冈藩等</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:23,325 --> 00:12:26,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中 萨摩藩和长州藩</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:26,411 --> 00:12:29,289
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为明治政府结构中的两大势力
长期占支配地位</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:29,373 --> 00:12:31,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>在此期间</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:31,875 --> 00:12:36,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>萨摩藩在警力管理具有绝对力量
长州藩则在军队管理具有绝对力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:37,673 --> 00:12:38,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:38,882 --> 00:12:43,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>是萨摩藩出身的维新志士的话
就难免会傲慢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:44,262 --> 00:12:47,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有 他这次又惹了什么麻烦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:47,724 --> 00:12:49,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个 实际上…</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:49,768 --> 00:12:54,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们其实一直在占下风
被区区一名剑客打</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:54,106 --> 00:12:55,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？岂有此理！</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:56,066 --> 00:12:58,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是从我们部门
最优秀的剑客中遴选出来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:59,069 --> 00:13:01,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:01,321 --> 00:13:03,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不可置信</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:03,281 --> 00:13:06,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那男人究竟是谁？
-不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:06,785 --> 00:13:11,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>是一个红头发的矮瘦男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:15,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>动作很快 几乎看不清</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:15,877 --> 00:13:20,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 我记得
他的左脸有一个很大的十字疤痕</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:22,217 --> 00:13:23,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:27,305 --> 00:13:28,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:29,599 --> 00:13:30,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:30,892 --> 00:13:33,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们因为人数多就手下留情了</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:33,103 --> 00:13:34,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你也太过分了吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:34,563 --> 00:13:36,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招 鹡鸰一刀流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:39,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招吧！雅居狮影流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:39,443 --> 00:13:41,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备迎接我的神道纪念流！</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:52,330 --> 00:13:53,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>还剩一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:56,543
<c.simplifiedchinese>只剩一个了！打败他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:56,626 --> 00:13:58,754
<c.simplifiedchinese>打倒那个傻瓜剑客警官！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:58,837 --> 00:14:03,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>向镇上的市民发誓
你不会再以这种方式欺压他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:04,551 --> 00:14:06,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>就到此为止吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:09,681
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你可以用
任何你喜欢的理由逮捕在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:09,765 --> 00:14:10,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>去你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:10,891 --> 00:14:13,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不会做这么丢脸的事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:14,102 --> 00:14:15,145
<c.simplifiedchinese>那气势</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:16,438 --> 00:14:20,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是无需二剑的示现流
萨摩藩最厉害的流派！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>宇治木 住手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:21,109 --> 00:14:22,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个人是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:22,527 --> 00:14:24,363
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:27,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>示现流确实是独特的流派</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:29,326 --> 00:14:30,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:30,285 --> 00:14:35,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>面对飞天御剑流时 毫无作用</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:44,216 --> 00:14:45,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:45,884 --> 00:14:47,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>有受伤吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:47,761 --> 00:14:49,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>太棒了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:52,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你是哪里人？
-和我们一起喝一杯吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:54,935 --> 00:14:56,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村！</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:58,021 --> 00:14:59,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>终于找到你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:00,649 --> 00:15:02,901
<c.simplifiedchinese>我找你十年了</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:02,984 --> 00:15:06,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>你留胡子了 山县先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:07,239 --> 00:15:09,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>山县？该不会是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:09,533 --> 00:15:15,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>帝国最强军队“奇兵队”的将军</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:15,705 --> 00:15:18,667
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士 山县有朋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:19,334 --> 00:15:22,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>-警官 请清下场
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:22,295 --> 00:15:24,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 快离开这里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:25,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>太咄咄逼人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:25,841 --> 00:15:27,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>稍后见！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:27,259 --> 00:15:29,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>我有马车在等我</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:30,387 --> 00:15:34,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很多战友一直在等你回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:35,684 --> 00:15:37,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:41,731 --> 00:15:43,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:44,192 --> 00:15:48,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没意向用刽子手的经验
来谋一份肥差</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:49,364 --> 00:15:50,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:50,866 --> 00:15:54,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使你杀了人 也是复辟王朝
伟大事业中令人钦佩的一部分</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:55,245 --> 00:15:58,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 有些人讨厌你是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:58,415 --> 00:16:00,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我还是会好好关照他们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:00,125 --> 00:16:02,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>利用官威镇压他们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:03,712 --> 00:16:08,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>正是这种想法造就了像他那样的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:09,426 --> 00:16:11,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们举起刀剑杀戮</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:12,637 --> 00:16:15,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了创建一个
人人可以追求幸福的世界</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:19,269
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是为了谋求有权有势
尽享荣华的职位</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:19,352 --> 00:16:26,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果忘了这点
我们就白白发起革命了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:32,032 --> 00:16:33,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是绯村！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:33,283 --> 00:16:36,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代变了！现在是明治时代！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:36,995 --> 00:16:39,998
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀剑被禁 武士也没落了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:40,081 --> 00:16:43,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>不像江户末期
刀剑是主流的时候了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:43,210 --> 00:16:45,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:45,128 --> 00:16:49,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有政府的力量
单凭一把剑是做不到任何事情的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:52,385 --> 00:16:54,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>单凭一把剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:57,057 --> 00:17:02,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少在下可以保护身边的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:04,022 --> 00:17:07,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>过去到现在 在下一直没变</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:07,317 --> 00:17:11,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>只不过由“刽子手”变为“浪客”了</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:18,787 --> 00:17:21,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>-长官…
-我明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:21,540 --> 00:17:26,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>看大家的反应就知道是谁的错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:26,419 --> 00:17:29,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的剑不构成危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:30,006 --> 00:17:31,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事就这样吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:31,716 --> 00:17:32,759
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:32,842 --> 00:17:35,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>这场恶作剧之前</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:36,012 --> 00:17:40,725
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为刽子手拔刀斋是危险人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:42,394 --> 00:17:45,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然真人还是很不一样的</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:48,066 --> 00:17:50,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:50,610 --> 00:17:51,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:51,778 --> 00:17:56,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的带子因为在下的缘故毁了</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:57,742 --> 00:18:01,913
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 你用心做家务就算补偿了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:02,747 --> 00:18:04,624
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有 不要忘记去杂货店买东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:04,708 --> 00:18:06,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不会走吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:06,209 --> 00:18:09,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>到家记得把要洗的衣服收起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:14,759 --> 00:18:17,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想我好像有点明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:19,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心为什么变成浪客了</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:21,266 --> 00:18:26,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样 他就可以继续
用剑保护大家的自由了</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:26,855 --> 00:18:29,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心听任命运安排</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:29,649 --> 00:18:31,943
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此 他成为了一名浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:40,285 --> 00:18:45,540
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来像个孩子
但内心已经像个大人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:45,624 --> 00:18:47,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:47,834 --> 00:18:48,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个小镇的市民</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:49,502 --> 00:18:51,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要对这些人拔剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:52,714 --> 00:18:55,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>想找对手的话 在下在此恭候</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:57,010 --> 00:18:57,969
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:06,102 --> 00:19:11,149
<c.simplifiedchinese>给不了钱 你就没价值了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:16,738 --> 00:19:17,781
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷活心流）</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:17,864 --> 00:19:19,115
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:25,372 --> 00:19:26,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:31,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个小孩…</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:31,961 --> 00:19:33,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是小孩子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:34,005 --> 00:19:36,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是东京武士之子 明神弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:36,633 --> 00:19:39,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还没那么堕落
不需要陌生人同情！</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:43,181 --> 00:19:48,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>在更好的世界里
他将来会是一名优秀的武士呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:16,631 --> 00:20:17,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:18,216 --> 00:20:19,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:20,885 --> 00:20:22,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在是晚上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:22,679 --> 00:20:26,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个月的钱结一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:26,099 --> 00:20:27,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我没有
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:28,059 --> 00:20:30,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>我再也不偷东西了</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:30,103 --> 00:20:31,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天起
我要和你们极道黑帮一刀两断</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:32,063 --> 00:20:34,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你知道你在说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:48,955 --> 00:20:51,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:53,168 --> 00:20:55,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没听错</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:58,465 --> 00:21:02,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只是厌倦了做像扒窃这样可悲的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:21:05,430 --> 00:21:08,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还是那么混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:21:08,850 --> 00:21:14,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候教教你谁是老大了</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:22:47,031 --> 00:22:50,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《活心流 重振声威》</c.simplifiedchinese>

